123: /// Deterministically projects the unallocated share of a repeating daily
124: /// schedule onto an absolute interval. Cumulative integer arithmetic makes
125: /// adjacent chunks telescope exactly without persisting a fractional remainder.
126: pub fn restorative_leisure_minutes(
127:     schedule: DailySchedule,
